@startuml
actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "EligibleEmailsController" as Controller
Admin -> UI: Submit member email
UI -> Controller: POST /organizations/{organizationId}/eligible-emails (RegisterEligibleEmailDto)
Controller --> UI: 201 Created (EligibleEmailDto) or 400/403/409
UI --> Admin: Show result
@enduml
